# All of plugins/* is generated by scripts/build-plugins.py from the canonical
# artifacts in skills/, agents/, mcp/. Don't hand-edit anything here.
#
# To regenerate before publishing:
#   python scripts/build-plugins.py
#
# We DO commit the .claude-plugin/plugin.json manifests (hand-maintained) and the
# .gitkeep below to anchor the plugin directories. We do NOT commit the generated
# content (skills/, agents/, mcp/, CLAUDE.md, etc.) — those are derivative.

# Generated content per plugin (regenerate via build-plugins.py)
*/skills/
*/agents/
*/commands/
*/docs/
*/CLAUDE.md
*/CONTEXT.md.template
*/README.md
*/.mcp.json
